    "text": "Let <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#8734;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8226;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp; Column 1 contains information about zeros of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8226;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp; Column 2 contains information about the limiting behaviour of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> at infinity.<br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8226;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp; Column 3 contains information about increasing-decreasing nature of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</m